3899 0 obj
<</AP<</N 4397 0 R >>/BS<</S/N/Type/Border/W 0>>/C[]/CA 1/Contents(\nConsolidate all Week 1 techniques by building a complete image preprocessing pipeline that chains grayscale conversion, \nGaussian blur, and Otsu's thresholding together; \ntest the pipeline on multiple images of different types; \nwrite clean, well-commented Python code and verify results at each stage of the pipeline.\n)/CreationDate(D:20260503083818Z)/DA(/Helvetica 14 Tf 0 0 0 rg )/DS(font:14.00pt "Helvetica"; color:#000000; )/F 4/FontName(Helvetica)/FontSize 14/M(D:20260503083900Z)/NM(01KQPFT17MFG2VKTDYKQ9DR3MN)/P 15 0 R /PSPDF:Id(7KQ22VJQ0348W2GQ5E6ESQ7VWB)/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:spec="2.0.2"><p style="font-size:14px;font-family:Helvetica"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-size:14px;font-family:Helvetica;text-align:initial">\nConsolidate all Week 1 techniques by building a complete image preprocessing pipeline that chains grayscale conversion, </span></p><p style="font-size:14px;font-family:Helvetica"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-size:14px;font-family:Helvetica;text-align:initial">Gaussian blur, and Otsu&#39;s thresholding together; </span></p><p style="font-size:14px;font-family:Helvetica"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-size:14px;font-family:Helvetica;text-align:initial">test the pipeline on multiple images of different types; </span></p><p style="font-size:14px;font-family:Helvetica"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-size:14px;font-family:Helvetica;text-align:initial">write clean, well-commented Python code and verify results at each stage of the pipeline.\n</span></p></body>)/Rect[ 50.421051 247.05231 601.42102 365.05231]/Resources<<>>/StructParent 102/Subtype/FreeText/Type/Annot>>
endobj
