<</Alt(\nExplore morphological image processing by creating custom structuring elements with cv2.getStructuringElement\(\) and \napplying erosion using cv2.erode\(\), dilation using cv2.dilate\(\), \nmorphological opening and closing using cv2.morphologyEx\(\); \nthen study image histograms using cv2.calcHist\(\) and visualize them with matplotlib; apply global histogram equalization using cv2.equalizeHist\(\) \nand compare it with CLAHE \(Contrast Limited Adaptive Histogram Equalization\) using cv2.createCLAHE\(\) on images with different lighting conditions.\n)/K 9002 0 R /P 914 0 R /S/Annot>>
endobj
