<</Obj 8316 0 R /P 9001 0 R /Pg 17 0 R /Type/OBJR>>
endobj
9003 0 obj
<</AP<</N 9684 0 R >>/BS<</S/N/Type/Border/W 0>>/C[]/CA 1/Contents(\nImplement template matching using cv2.matchTemplate\(\) with multiple matching methods including TM_CCOEFF_NORMED and TM_SQDIFF_NORMED, \nlocate the best match using cv2.minMaxLoc\(\), and draw a bounding box around the result; \n\nthen apply a Haar Cascade classifier using cv2.CascadeClassifier\(\) and detectMultiScale\(\) to detect faces in still images; \n\ncomplete the internship with a final real-time project: a webcam-based face detection application using cv2.VideoCapture\(\) that processes live video frames and draws annotated bounding boxes around detected faces.\n)/CreationDate(D:20260503084216Z)/DA(/Helvetica 14 Tf 0 0 0 rg )/DS(font:14.00pt "Helvetica"; color:#000000; )/F 4/FontName(Helvetica)/FontSize 14/M(D:20260503084312Z)/NM(01KQPG1AH300GQX1DHTKH4TWDE)/P 17 0 R /PSPDF:Id(7KQ22VJQ09X2WT22SR3QDNT56X)/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:spec="2.0.2"><p style="font-size:14px;font-family:Helvetica"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-size:14px;font-family:Helvetica;text-align:initial">\nImplement template matching using cv2.matchTemplate\(\) with multiple matching methods including TM_CCOEFF_NORMED and TM_SQDIFF_NORMED, </span></p><p style="font-size:14px;font-family:Helvetica"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-size:14px;font-family:Helvetica;text-align:initial">locate the best match using cv2.minMaxLoc\(\), and draw a bounding box around the result; </span></p><p style="font-size:14px;font-family:Helvetica"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-size:14px;font-family:Helvetica;text-align:initial"></span></p><p style="font-size:14px;font-family:Helvetica"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-size:14px;font-family:Helvetica;text-align:initial">then apply a Haar Cascade classifier using cv2.CascadeClassifier\(\) and detectMultiScale\(\) to detect faces in still images; </span></p><p style="font-size:14px;font-family:Helvetica"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-size:14px;font-family:Helvetica;text-align:initial"></span></p><p style="font-size:14px;font-family:Helvetica"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-size:14px;font-family:Helvetica;text-align:initial">complete the internship with a final real-time project: a webcam-based face detection application using cv2.VideoCapture\(\) that processes live video frames and draws annotated bounding boxes around detected faces.\n</span></p></body>)/Rect[ 26 147.894775 592 349.89474]/Resources<<>>/StructParent 106/Subtype/FreeText/Type/Annot>>
endobj
9418 0 obj
<</Alt(\nImplement template matching using cv2.matchTemplate\(\) with multiple matching methods including TM_CCOEFF_NORMED and TM_SQDIFF_NORMED, locate the best match using cv2.minMaxLoc\(\), and draw a bounding box around the result; then apply a Haar Cascade classifier using cv2.CascadeClassifier\(\) and detectMultiScale\(\) to detect faces in still images; complete the internship with a final real-time project: a webcam-based face detection application using cv2.VideoCapture\(\) that processes live video frames and draws annotated bounding boxes around detected faces.\n)/K 9419 0 R /P 933 0 R /S/Annot>>
endobj
