t-in Haar Cascade frontal face classifier using cv2.CascadeClassifier\(\) and detectMultiScale\(\) to detect faces in still images with bounding boxes.\nOn Day 12, I completed the internship with a real-time face detection project. I used cv2.VideoCapture\(0\) to open the webcam, read frames in a loop, converted each frame to grayscale, applied the Haar Cascade detector, and drew bounding boxes around detected faces using cv2.rectangle\(\). I tuned scaleFactor and minNeighbors parameters to reduce false positives and achieve stable detection. This final project successfully combined every concept from both weeks into a working computer vision application.)/K 12580 0 R /P 959 0 R /S/Annot>>
