<</Alt(\nPracticed image resizing using cv2.resize\(\) with INTER_LINEAR, INTER_NEAREST, and INTER_CUBIC interpolation methods and compared visual quality when upscaling and downscaling. Cropped specific regions of interest using NumPy array slicing with row and column index ranges. Drew geometric shapes on images using cv2.line\(\), cv2.rectangle\(\), and cv2.circle\(\), and added text annotations using cv2.putText\(\) with different fonts, sizes, and colors.\n)/K 15764 0 R /P 1049 0 R /S/Annot>>
